#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0239 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "TRTA present but no TRTPG* and no TRTAG* column. Only the two template names (TRTPGy, TRTAGy) participate in expansion; neither matches, so anyAnchor is false and the expansion list is empty -> NoMatch -> the rule does not execute. A plain BDS dataset that simply does not pool treatments is SKIPPED, not silently passed."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col TRTA    type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | DRUGA | 5.4
